WEBVTT

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:10.370
What? Somethin' ain't right here.

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:12.520
Where's Mom?

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:13.990
Shopping.

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:17.530
Oh? Even you're not looking 
so good, Hilda-chan.

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:21.020
Tatasumi, what have you done this time?

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:23.330
Baby Beel looks seriously peeved.

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:26.890
Oh, shut it. None of your 
business, lamebrain.

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:33.520
Your ever-so-kind sister is asking 
because she is worried about you!

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:36.040
I know, I know! The ice cream bar is...

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:40.230
A little cat?

00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:42.310
What's with this guy? You picked him up?

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:49.940
What, what? Huh? What?

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:56.050
This is a story of a high school 
juvenile delinquent who,

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:58.220
through some strange 
circumstances, is raising a baby.

00:00:58.220 --> 00:01:01.950
However that baby is no ordinary baby.

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:04.330
It is a baby Demon Lord!

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:50.020
A Disciple Was Gained

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:55.750
Let me explain.

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:59.530
It all started on the way 
home from school today.

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:03.480
Ah, please don't come any 
closer with that kitty, okay?

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:05.660
Uh, sure.

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:08.290
But, what are you doing 
under our table, big fella?

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:09.500
And who are you?

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:11.540
My name is Alaindelon.

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:14.150
I'll just be setting up a flashback now...

00:03:14.150 --> 00:03:15.130
Righty then.

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:16.930
Pardon me.

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:17.350
Hey!

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:18.370
Off we go!

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:20.050
<b>Fujino's Meat</b>

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:22.130
Lady, gimme a fist croquette!

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:25.050
<b>Fist Croquettes</b>

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:25.050
Here ya go! Thanks, as always.

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:26.450
Buying one, again?

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:28.290
Is it really that tasty?

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.650
What a stupid question.

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:34.660
Fujino's croquettes have been there 
for me ever since elementary school.

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:37.040
They're basically the taste I grew up with.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:40.340
Oh, you want some too?

00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:41.280
Here.

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:52.570
Oh, a stray cat...

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:54.580
Looks like it's quite 
happy with its catch...

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:56.620
Cat...

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:01.400
I'll steal your very soul!

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:08.850
Stop following me!

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:12.030
I think I've heard this plot before.

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:14.970
Are you scared of cats?

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:16.300
Yes-yes...

00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:19.980
My head has been bitten 
countless times before...

00:04:22.020 --> 00:04:26.240
That cat has become extremely 
attached to Oga-dono.

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:32.790
Please... Don't come near me.

00:04:41.850 --> 00:04:45.260
Of course, the Master is not amused.

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:50.290
Hilda-sama attempted to appease him, but...

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:51.790
Master...

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:56.680
A Demon Lord must grow into 
a person of great caliber.

00:04:56.680 --> 00:05:00.260
If your ire is raised each time you 
lay eyes on that minor annoyance,

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:02.170
you can never become a great Demon Lord.

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:03.430
Master!

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:04.760
Anyway, here...

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:08.910
Hilda has made you croquettes instead!

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:19.850
What? You're giving it to me?

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.460
What is the meaning of this?

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:27.130
You want to eat them?

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:42.410
And that is what happened.

00:05:43.010 --> 00:05:45.390
Whatever shall I do?

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:53.580
I see...

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:56.350
Raising a kid is tough, that's for sure.

00:05:56.350 --> 00:06:00.710
Don't just stand there chatting 
about it, do something!

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:03.590
But I'm scared of cats, so...

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:08.000
Cats... are so very fearsome!

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.020
How the hell is that a cat?!

00:06:22.680 --> 00:06:24.580
This isn't funny anymore.

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:26.240
Listen up, Baby Beel.

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:30.450
This ain't about becoming a 
great Demon Lord or whatever...

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:32.630
It's just not manly, that's what!

00:06:32.630 --> 00:06:36.150
If you got somethin' you wanna 
say, then say it loud and clear!

00:06:36.150 --> 00:06:38.660
Uh, he's a baby, lamebrain.

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:40.000
Right?

00:06:40.260 --> 00:06:44.990
Anyway, Tatsumi, don't you even 
realize why Baby Beel's angry?

00:06:44.990 --> 00:06:46.920
Huh? How should I know?

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:49.440
He's just fussy all of a sudden.

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:02.570
You're so dense.

00:07:02.570 --> 00:07:06.170
He's jealous, got it? The 
green-eyed monster got 'im.

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:08.190
Aren't you Mr. Popular?

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:20.810
B-Beelze-sama!

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:24.420
As you wish!

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:26.920
Open, me!

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:29.970
<b>Letter of Challenge</b>

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:31.440
Ah, it came out!

00:07:31.440 --> 00:07:32.520
How useful!

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:35.220
The whenever-wherever-whomever 
letter of challenge!

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:57.720
Are you sure you don't want to stop them?

00:07:57.720 --> 00:08:00.870
Don't want any part of it. 
Fightin' a cat! How childish!

00:08:12.190 --> 00:08:14.460
His weakness knows no bounds...

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:16.620
So pitiful...

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:30.650
I don't recall you asking permission 
to have a fight here...

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:30.650
<b>From now on, please enjoy cat-language</b>

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:33.650
This here's our territory!

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:35.660
Get out!

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:37.600
They're totally scary!

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:41.380
Master!

00:08:41.380 --> 00:08:42.070
Wait.

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:55.090
Be-san!

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:56.800
<b>Be-san = Baby Beel (presumably)</b>

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:04.530
This will be like taking 
candy from a baby! Literally!

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:16.760
It's a demon!

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:18.070
A demon!

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:22.680
That's the rampaging Ogre that 
even threatens meowing kittens!

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:29.010
Eeek, beat it outta here! He's gonna eat us!

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:32.050
Don't look into his eyes! Not in his eyes!

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:39.380
Hey, good going there.

00:09:39.380 --> 00:09:40.820
Very manly of you.

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:45.290
Let's go home.

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:53.200
Master, that was splendid earlier.

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:56.060
Now, I remade them, so...

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:05.870
Be-san, I can't compete with your manliness!

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:08.920
Please allow me to study with you here!

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:11.630
Thank you very much...

00:10:12.030 --> 00:10:13.370
What's going on?

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:16.380
Well, they seem to be communicating.

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:20.220
Master?

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:24.310
So hot!

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:26.770
What the hell did you put in these?

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:31.450
The color and aroma of 
this "tabasco" product,

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:35.260
resembles that of the blood from a live 
cockatrice, one of the master's favorites...

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:37.280
I used a good amount.

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:45.540
Baby Beel, don't! You're a man, right?!

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:10.180
That wasn't any good?

00:11:15.530 --> 00:11:17.940
Oh, I see... Like this, right?

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:25.420
Well, I'm glad they get along now, but 
what the heck do they do everyday anyway?

00:11:25.420 --> 00:11:30.210
He has gained his first underling in the 
Human World, so the Master is surely pleased.

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:32.660
Underling, huh?

00:11:32.660 --> 00:11:34.280
Hey Tatsumi!

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:36.710
What the hell is it now?

00:11:39.120 --> 00:11:41.470
What? A children's playcenter?!

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:47.040
That's right. A cat is fine, but he 
should make friends of kids his own age!

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:49.220
I told you before, remember?

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:53.230
At the children's playcenter there 
are plenty of kids Beel-chan's age!

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:55.980
Can he even make friends?

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:59.990
No backtalk! Stop lounging 
around at home and just go!

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:03.340
Sheesh, fine... I get it already!

00:12:03.340 --> 00:12:05.010
Tch. Damn it.

00:12:05.010 --> 00:12:06.180
Stay safe.

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:09.130
What, you're not coming?

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:12.300
Wait, don't tell me you've 
got more soaps to watch...

00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:15.800
Today is a recap episode, so 
there's no reason to watch.

00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:17.220
That's not the reason...

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:21.330
Hilda-chan, we're going to 
practice making croquettes!

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:21.970
Huh?

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:23.580
Okay, coming!

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:31.160
Crap, why's it always gotta be me?

00:12:32.650 --> 00:12:34.760
Shut the hell up, you two!

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:03.260
This is no good... What'll I 
do? Maybe I should help him...

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:06.300
No, but asking them to be 
his friends wouldn't...

00:13:11.070 --> 00:13:12.400
Why is he here?

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:14.710
Oh, it's you!

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:14.620
Wait, this is risky!

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:18.060
I'm in my different outfit, thankfully.

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:20.720
We met at the park before, right?

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:22.260
Long time no see...

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:25.320
Still draggin' the kid with you, I see?

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:27.260
We sure got it tough, don't we?

00:13:27.260 --> 00:13:30.830
This is great timing. I 
brought him here and all,

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:33.030
but I was thinking I wouldn't 
have anything to do.

00:13:33.030 --> 00:13:35.030
H-He hasn't noticed?

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:35.330
Let's chat.

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:38.580
Actually, he's a lot nicer 
than when we met at school.

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:41.610
Okay! You guys, get in there and play.

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:52.140
W-What's with the cat?

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:54.740
Yeah, he's really gotten attached to me.

00:13:54.740 --> 00:13:57.140
Baby Beel's taken a liking to him too.

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:03.360
They think we're a couple!

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:06.900
C-Could this be considered a date?

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:09.420
Hey, what about becoming friends?

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:12.380
F-Friends?

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:14.400
Friends, and from friends to...

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:15.950
How far beyond friends does he mean?

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:19.810
Man, my mom keeps telling 
me to hurry up! What a nag.

00:14:19.810 --> 00:14:21.450
Hurry up and what?!

00:14:21.450 --> 00:14:23.040
Get married, right?

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:25.960
He's going so far! Things are 
progressing way too fast!

00:14:28.310 --> 00:14:33.970
I wish I'd studied Bessatsu Margaret 
and not just historical fiction!

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:35.980
Hey, you okay?

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:40.930
I am fine! Nothing is wrong!

00:14:58.850 --> 00:15:00.750
Be-san, go for it!

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:14.710
But, it's all just so fast, you know...

00:15:14.950 --> 00:15:16.900
Huh? What is?

00:15:16.900 --> 00:15:18.450
You know the...

00:15:19.360 --> 00:15:22.860
...becoming friends, and then 
taking it all the way...

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:25.400
That's what's so sudden, I guess...

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:27.170
All the way?

00:15:27.170 --> 00:15:31.530
Ah. Well, I guess if there's a 
spark, it might last a lifetime...

00:15:32.050 --> 00:15:34.100
But sure. That'll probably happen.

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:36.500
I mean, I think I see a spark.

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:38.500
S-Sure, that's true.

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:40.790
He said we've got a spark!

00:15:41.130 --> 00:15:43.170
I mean, we're definitely talking 
friendly feelings here...

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:44.290
Or, wait...

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:46.370
Was that just a propo...

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:46.930
A pretty good combination, yeah.

00:15:46.930 --> 00:15:47.730
...sal!

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:54.120
Hey, are you sure you're okay?

00:15:54.460 --> 00:15:56.560
I-I'm fine!

00:16:22.630 --> 00:16:24.090
Be-san!

00:16:40.710 --> 00:16:42.140
Be-san!

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:43.900
Angry?

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:51.480
Go for it, Be-san!

00:16:57.640 --> 00:17:02.540
It's fine! You don't have to 
be angry for me any more...

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:04.920
I... I...

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:07.510
Be-san!

00:17:18.870 --> 00:17:22.180
If things keep going well...

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:30.940
R-Right! I have to make sure...

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:33.740
U-Uh, Oga-kun...

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:34.890
What is it?

00:17:34.890 --> 00:17:39.680
You have someone else you're 
raising the kid with, right?

00:17:39.680 --> 00:17:42.370
Ah... Yeah, I do, I suppose.

00:17:42.610 --> 00:17:45.970
What do you think of that person?

00:17:45.970 --> 00:17:48.960
What do I think? I think she's a demon.

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:51.370
I've heard that before...

00:17:51.370 --> 00:17:54.050
Er, I mean...

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:56.430
Do you love her... or not?

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:58.320
Huh?

00:17:59.480 --> 00:18:03.930
I was just wondering if leaving him 
in her care is the right thing to do?

00:18:04.480 --> 00:18:07.410
I see. I didn't realize you 
had such strong feelings.

00:18:08.260 --> 00:18:09.520
For Baby Beel, that is.

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:16.740
Not just Kota... You want to be 
Baby Beel's lifelong friend too?

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:18.490
That saves me a lot of time.

00:18:18.820 --> 00:18:20.640
Kota and Baby Beel...

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:24.150
Start off as friends... Have a spark...

00:18:24.150 --> 00:18:26.500
You were talking about them?!

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:29.180
Huh? Well, duh.

00:18:29.180 --> 00:18:30.250
What are you saying?

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:37.190
Earlier there was this broad waving a wooden 
sword around that Baby Beel liked too...

00:18:37.190 --> 00:18:41.140
I really do think women are 
better for Baby Beel, you know?

00:18:42.150 --> 00:18:45.860
Hmm, what was her name again?

00:18:45.860 --> 00:18:49.400
Let me think... Ku... Ku...

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:50.660
Ku...

00:18:50.660 --> 00:18:53.290
I think you mean Kunieda!

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:57.780
Oh, that's right! Kunieda, yup.

00:18:58.800 --> 00:19:00.030
How'd you know that?

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:11.850
Be-san!

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:30.960
Hey...

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:33.940
Making an utter fool out of me!

00:19:51.010 --> 00:19:52.920
Ko-san, amazing!

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:55.290
<b>Ko-san = Kota (presumably)</b>

00:19:55.690 --> 00:19:57.490
Baby Beel, you used that?

00:19:58.110 --> 00:20:00.320
Make a run for it!

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:02.300
What the...

00:20:03.360 --> 00:20:05.730
You make friends with Kota?

00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:07.540
I see.

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:11.060
It looks like that girl will 
be your lifelong friend too.

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:16.540
Now I can live in peace 
without my mom nagging me.

00:20:18.590 --> 00:20:19.570
What's this?

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:25.760
Some damn strays trying to show us, huh?

00:20:25.760 --> 00:20:29.580
Don't go putting on such a brave 
face in someone else's backyard!

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:34.330
Ugh... Playin' dead, playin' dead...

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:42.110
Who the hell are you?

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:51.390
W-Who is he?

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:53.120
He's not just some cat!

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:55.440
He's a demon! A demon!

00:20:56.110 --> 00:20:57.700
He's gonna chomp us to death!

00:20:57.700 --> 00:20:59.110
Run away!

00:21:03.850 --> 00:21:07.490
I-I guess I'll let you live for now...

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:17.750
Be-san... You and Ko-san 
were so cool back then!

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:25.750
I think I'm going to try and make a 
friend for myself just like you two are!

00:21:25.750 --> 00:21:28.760
I am sorry for being so selfish as 
to beg your leave... But, please...

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:34.060
Thank you so much!

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:38.900
Bro, they were so scary!

00:21:37.920 --> 00:21:40.780
The real deal sure are different!

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:41.780
Knock on wood...

00:23:29.780 --> 00:23:32.760
Now, Master, eat up as much as you'd like.

00:23:40.790 --> 00:23:43.180
I have plenty more.

00:23:46.140 --> 00:23:47.780
Eww...

00:24:02.300 --> 00:24:04.040
Money makes the world go round.

00:24:04.040 --> 00:24:05.780
There is nothing that money can't buy.

00:24:06.050 --> 00:24:07.420
That's not true!

00:24:07.420 --> 00:24:09.210
There is something money can't buy!

00:24:09.210 --> 00:24:13.720
Like Hilda-san's wonderful smile 
or Hilda-san's gigantic boobs!

00:24:13.720 --> 00:24:15.860
Fine, then we'll just test that theory.

00:24:15.860 --> 00:24:18.100
I'm looking forward to next week.

00:24:18.100 --> 00:24:19.560
Seriously, Himekawa-san?

00:24:19.560 --> 00:24:22.470
I should be looking forward to it, right?

00:24:22.470 --> 00:24:26.570
On the next Beelzebub: There was 
something money couldn't buy!

00:24:26.570 --> 00:24:28.330
Oh, sure! Just spoil it why don't you.
